! CP2K input template for the initial-guess benchmark.
!
! Rendered per structure by hotspot_al.cp2k_ml_scf.structures. Recognised
! placeholders: PROJECT, COORD, CELL, KIND, GUESS (in double braces).
!
! This is deliberately NOT the dataset template. There is no &AO_MATRICES
! block: printing the density every iteration is O(nao^2) of text per step and
! would dominate the wall-clock number the benchmark exists to measure.
!
! RUN_TYPE ENERGY_FORCE, because "the ML guess did not change the answer" has
! to be checked on forces as well as energy. Forces are the derivative of the
! converged state and are the more sensitive test of the two.
!
! SCF_GUESS is the only thing that differs between the two arms of the
! benchmark. Everything else is byte-identical, which is what makes the
! comparison a measurement rather than an anecdote.

&GLOBAL
  PROJECT {{PROJECT}}
  RUN_TYPE ENERGY_FORCE
  PRINT_LEVEL MEDIUM
&END GLOBAL
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD QUICKSTEP
  &PRINT
    &FORCES ON
    &END FORCES
  &END PRINT
  &DFT
    BASIS_SET_FILE_NAME BASIS_MOLOPT
    POTENTIAL_FILE_NAME POTENTIAL
    &SCF
      SCF_GUESS {{GUESS}}
      EPS_SCF 1.0E-6
      MAX_SCF 80
      &MIXING
        METHOD PULAY_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.4
        NBUFFER 8
      &END MIXING
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PBE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 400
      REL_CUTOFF 50
    &END MGRID
  &END DFT
  &SUBSYS
    &CELL
{{CELL}}
    &END CELL
    &COORD
{{COORD}}
    &END COORD
{{KIND}}
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
